<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Password Reset Successful - Emergency Ambulance Dispatch</title>

    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #f7f7f7;
        color: #333;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 500px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        background: #fff;
        padding: 30px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }

      .icon-wrapper {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .icon {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 56px;
        height: 56px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: #fef2f2;
        color: #dc2626;
        font-size: 28px;
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      h2 {
        margin-top: 0;
        color: #dc2626;
        text-align: center;
      }

      p {
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .notice {
        background: #fef2f2;
        border-left: 4px solid #dc2626;
        padding: 15px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        border-radius: 4px;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #666;
      }

      .footer {
        margin-top: 30px;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #888;
        text-align: center;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="icon-wrapper">
        <div class="icon">&#10003;</div>
      </div>

      <h2>Password Reset Successful</h2>

      <p>Hello <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>

      <p>
        Your password for the
        <strong>Emergency Ambulance Dispatch System</strong> account has been
        changed successfully.
      </p>

      <p>You can now log in to your account using your new credentials.</p>

      <div class="notice">
        <p style="margin: 0">
          <strong>Security Notice:</strong> If you did not perform this action,
          please reset your password immediately or contact our emergency
          support team.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p>
        Best regards,<br />
        <strong>Emergency Ambulance Dispatch System Team</strong>
      </p>

      <div class="footer">
        &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Emergency Ambulance Dispatch
        System. All rights reserved.
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
